cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "ARLMP Benchmark v1.0 — Full Experimental Data Release"
abstract: >
  Complete dataset, scripts, and results from the ARLMP serialization
  benchmark study evaluating seven metadata serialization formats
  (JSON, minJSON, YAML, TOML, TOON, Markdown, ARLMP-Min) across
  616 resolved public-web URLs and 54,591 API calls with three
  large language models (GPT-5.4 mini, Claude Sonnet 4.6,
  DeepSeek-V4 Pro) on four agentic decision tasks.
